#: src/onboarding.glade:87
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Rydyn ni wedi gorffen! Mae Ubuntu Hello bellach yn weithredol ar y cyf"
"rifiadur hwn. Ceisiwch wneud unrhyw beth y byddai'n rhaid i chi fel ar"
"fer deipio'ch cyfrinair i'w ddilysu, fel rhedeg gorchymyn gyda sudo. O"
"s gwnaethoch alluogi datgloi cylch allweddi yn awtomatig, bydd eich cy"
"lch allweddi mewngofnodi neu KWallet hefyd yn cael ei datgloi'n awtoma"
"tig wrth fewngofnodi.\n\nGallwch agor y Cyflunydd Ubuntu Hello yn nes "
"ymlaen i newid gosodiadau mwy datblygedig neu ychwanegu modelau ychwan"
"egol. Pwyswch Gorffen isod i gau'r ffenestr hon ac agorwch y Cyflunydd"
" Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/onboarding.glade:135
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Gall Ubuntu Hello ddatgloi eich cylch allweddi mewngofnodi yn awtomati"
"g neu KWallet ddefnyddio dilysu wynebau, atal awgrymiadau cyfrinair ar"
" ôl mewngofnodi."

#: src/onboarding.glade:147
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Galluogi cylch allweddi awtomatig / datgloi KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.glade:189
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Cadarnhau cyfrinair"

#: src/onboarding.glade:221
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Gosod polisi sicrwydd"

#: src/onboarding.glade:240
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Oherwydd newidiadau mewn onglau, pellter, a ffactorau eraill nid yw cy"
"dweddiad wyneb byth yn union yr un fath â'r model wyneb sydd wedi'i st"
"orio. Ar y dudalen hon gallwch chi osod pa mor llym y dylai Ubuntu Hel"
"lo fod."

#: src/onboarding.glade:279
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cyflym"

#: src/onboarding.glade:295
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Yn caniatáu mwy o gemau niwlog, \nond yn cyflymu'r broses sganio yn fa"
"wr."

#: src/onboarding.glade:334
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Cytbwys"

#: src/onboarding.glade:350
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Dal i ganfod yn gymharol gyflym, \nond efallai na fydd yn eich mewngof"
"nodi pan fyddwch ymhellach i ffwrdd."

#: src/onboarding.glade:389
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Diogel"

#: src/onboarding.glade:405
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Yr opsiwn ychydig yn fwy diogel, \nond bydd yn cymryd llawer mwy o ams"
"er i'ch dilysu"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Hepgor am y tro"

#: src/onboarding.glade:550
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Gallwch ychwanegu rhagor o fodelau wyneb yn nes ymlaen o'r Gosodiadau "
"neu gyda: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:583 src/onboarding.glade:674
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Ffurfweddu gwe-gamera"

#: src/onboarding.glade:600
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "A yw'r allyrrydd isgoch yn fflachio?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:618
msgid "yes"
msgstr "oes"

#: src/onboarding.glade:635
msgid "no"
msgstr "nac oes"

#: src/onboarding.glade:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Bydd Ubuntu Hello yn chwilio'ch system yn awtomatig am unrhyw gamerâu "
"sydd ar gael, felly gwnewch yn siŵr bod eich gwe-gamera wedi'i gysyllt"
"u. Ar ôl canfod, dangosir rhestr o we-gamerâu defnyddiadwy. Dewiswch y"
"r un rydych chi am ei ddefnyddio a chliciwch ar Next."

#: src/onboarding.glade:715
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Wrth brofi eich gwe-gamerâu, arhoswch..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:767
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Lawrlwytho ffeiliau data"

#: src/onboarding.glade:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Mae angen tair set ddata adnabod wynebau wedi'u hyfforddi ymlaen llaw "
"ar Ubuntu Hello i'ch adnabod, a fydd yn cael eu llwytho i lawr nawr. G"
"allwch weld y cynnydd lawrlwytho isod."

#: src/onboarding.glade:807
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Yn dechrau llwytho i lawr..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:856
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Croeso i Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:872
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Fersiwn"

#: src/onboarding.glade:893
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Bydd y dewin hwn yn eich arwain trwy'r broses sefydlu ac yn ffurfweddu"
" Ubuntu Hello yn awtomatig i chi. Pwyswch nesaf i barhau."

#: src/onboarding.glade:917
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Canslo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:934
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Yn ol"

#: src/onboarding.glade:954
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Nesaf"

#: src/onboarding.glade:979
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Gorffen gosod"

